{"task_id": "9352e78790864bf5", "model_key": "deepseek-v4-1-flash", "raw_response": "Pair factors to simplify:\n\\[\n(-5x+4)(5x+4)=16-25x^2\n\\]\nand\n\\[\n(3x-1)(-4x-2)=-12x^2-2x+2.\n\\]\nThen\n\\[\n(-x+3)(-12x^2-2x+2)=12x^3-34x^2-8x+6.\n\\]\nThe coefficient of \\(x^2\\) in\n\\[\n(16-25x^2)(12x^3-34x^2-8x+6)\n\\]\nis\n\\[\n16(-34)+(-25)(6)=-544-150=-694.\n\\]\n\n{\"answer\":\"-694\"}", "parsed_answer": "-694", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 7579, "usage": {"input": 268, "output": 1689, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 1533, "totalTokens": 1957, "cost": {"input": 8.04e-05, "output": 0.0020268, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0021072}}, "cost_usd": 0.0021072, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-flash", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "max", "responseId": "a1155edb-eea0-46ee-8a70-ac3008b09506"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-18T03:45:20+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-18T03:45:27+00:00"}
