{"task_id": "d584ee50edecc60f", "model_key": "deepseek-v4-1-flash", "raw_response": "The coefficient of \\(x^6\\) is the sum of products where exactly two factors contribute their constant terms, with the remaining factors contributing their \\(x\\)-coefficients.\n\nThe product of all \\(x\\)-coefficients is \\(6720\\). Writing each factor as \\(a_i x+b_i\\), the required coefficient is\n\\[\n6720\\sum_{i<j}\\frac{b_i}{a_i}\\frac{b_j}{a_j}.\n\\]\nFor the eight factors, this gives\n\\[\n6720\\cdot \\frac{691}{14}=331680.\n\\]\n\n{\"answer\":\"331680\"}", "parsed_answer": "331680", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 13445, "usage": {"input": 284, "output": 3357, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 3237, "totalTokens": 3641, "cost": {"input": 8.52e-05, "output": 0.0040284, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.004113599999999999}}, "cost_usd": 0.004113599999999999, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "deepseek", "model": "deepseek-flash", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "max", "responseId": "8c9307c8-2596-4f86-89ae-900b6c6640ae"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-18T03:45:41+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-18T03:45:54+00:00"}
